.TH xil-publish 1  "xil-publish " 
.SH NAME
xil\-publish \- Generate social media post drafts from parsed episode data. Reads a parsed episode JSON and calls the Claude API to draft three ready\-to\-edit post variants (Hype, Quote, Spotlight) for Facebook or Instagram, written to posts/<slug>/<tag>_posts.md.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBxil\-publish\fR [\fB\-\-episode\fR] [\fB\-\-tag\fR] [\fB\-\-all\fR] [\fB\-\-show\fR] [\fB\-\-platform\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-\-model\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Generate social media post drafts from parsed episode data. Reads a parsed episode JSON and calls the Claude API to draft three ready\-to\-edit post variants (Hype, Quote, Spotlight) for Facebook or Instagram, written to posts/<slug>/<tag>_posts.md.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-episode\fR \fI<EPISODE>\fR
Episode tag (e.g. S04E01)
.TP
\fB\-\-tag\fR \fI<TAG>\fR
Raw content tag (e.g. V01C03)
.TP
\fB\-\-all\fR
Generate posts for every parsed episode under the current show slug
.TP
\fB\-\-show\fR \fI<SHOW>\fR
Show name override (default: from project.json)
.TP
\fB\-\-platform\fR \fI<PLATFORM>\fR [default: facebook]
Target platform — affects post length/style guidance (default: facebook)
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
facebook
.IP \(bu 2
instagram
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Print prompt and token estimate without making an API call or writing files
.TP
\fB\-\-model\fR \fI<MODEL>\fR [default: claude\-haiku\-4\-5\-20251001]
Claude model ID (default: claude\-haiku\-4\-5\-20251001)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH EXTRA
Requires the ANTHROPIC_API_KEY environment variable (except with \-\-dry\-run) and the [publish] extra: pip install \*(Aqxil\-pipeline[publish]\*(Aq.
